<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia end-June palm oil stocks 786,123 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Malaysia end-June palm oil stocks 786,123 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's palm oil stocks rose 10.37 percent to 786,123 tonnes at end-June from 712,289 at end-May and compared with 773,920 at end-June 1996, the Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority (PORLA) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
